ISTORY OF ALL REQUESTS
=====================================================================
Arquivo consolidado com todos os requests para teste do projeto.
Execute cada bloco separadamente (separados por ###).
=====================================================================


=====================================================================
1. CRIAR TRANSAÇÕES
=====================================================================

### Criar transação - GROCERIES (sem createdAt)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Compras no supermercado",
  "category": "GROCERIES",
  "amount": 15450
}

### Criar transação - PHARMA (sem createdAt)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Remédio para gripe",
  "category": "PHARMA",
  "amount": 3200
}

### Criar transação - AUTO (sem createdAt)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Abastecimento do carro",
  "category": "AUTO",
  "amount": 25000
}

### Criar transação - GROCERIES com createdAt
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Feira semanal",
  "category": "GROCERIES",
  "amount": 8700,
  "createdAt": "2026-08-21T14:30:00Z"
}

### Criar transação - PHARMA com createdAt
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Vitamina C",
  "category": "PHARMA",
  "amount": 4500,
  "createdAt": "2026-08-15T09:00:00Z"
}

### Criar transação - AUTO com createdAt
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Troca de óleo",
  "category": "AUTO",
  "amount": 18000,
  "createdAt": "2026-07-10T11:00:00Z"
}


=====================================================================
2. LISTAR POR CATEGORIA
=====================================================================

### Listar transações - GROCERIES
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/GROCERIES

### Listar transações - PHARMA
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/PHARMA

### Listar transações - AUTO
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/AUTO


=====================================================================
3. LISTAR POR SEMANA (ISO)
=====================================================================

### Semana 34 de 2026 (AGO 17-23)
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/week/2026/34

### Semana 33 de 2026 (AGO 10-16)
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/week/2026/33

### Semana 1 de 2026
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/week/2026/1

### Semana inválida (0) → 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/week/2026/0

### Semana inválida (54) → 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/week/2026/54


=====================================================================
4. LISTAR POR MÊS
=====================================================================

### Agosto 2026
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/month/2026/8

### Julho 2026
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/month/2026/7

### Janeiro 2026
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/month/2026/1

### Mês inválido (0) → 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/month/2026/0

### Mês inválido (13) → 400 Bad Request
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/month/2026/13


=====================================================================
5. TRANSCRIÇÃO DE ÁUDIO (IA)
=====================================================================

### Transcrever áudio via IA (substitua o caminho do arquivo)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/ai
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recording-1.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/mp4

< ./src/test/resources/audio/recording-1.m4a
--boundary--
